{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06601","headline":"夏日寻蓝田唐丞登高宴集 · 储光羲","name":"夏日寻蓝田唐丞登高宴集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东望春明门，驾言聊出游。\n南行小径尽，绿竹临清流。\n君出罢六安，居此澹忘忧。\n园林与城市，闾里随人幽。\n披颜辟衡闱，置酒登崇丘。\n山河临咫尺，宇宙穷寸眸。\n是时春载阳，佳气满皇州。\n宫殿碧云里，鸳鸯初命俦。\n良辰方在兹，志士安得休。\n成名苟有地，何必东陵侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06601.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06601","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}